OL,3,ASecurity flaw found in Java, world's
OL,4,Athird-largest programming language
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyber-security company has used
OL,7,Fartificial intelligence (AI) to uncover
OL,8,Fa security flaw in the hugely popular
OL,9,Fcomputer language program Java.
OL,11,FThe tech start-up Calif ` which
OL,12,Frecently identified a cyber-security
OL,13,Fflaw in another programming language,
OL,14,FPHP ` found the critical software bug
OL,15,Fin Java's memory functions.
OL,17,FJava is the world's third largest
OL,18,Fprogramming language used by 90% of the
OL,19,Fworld's Fortune 500 companies like
OL,20,FApple and Amazon, and used by many of
OL,21,Fthe world's banks, hospitals and
OL,22,Fgovernment agencies.
