OL,3,ASecurity flaw found in Java, world's
OL,4,Athird-largest programming language
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discovery comes after a string of
OL,7,Ftechnological outages across the world,
OL,8,Fincluding a massive Microsoft outage
OL,9,Fand a network failure that grounded all
OL,10,FUS flights. US Secretary of State Marco
OL,11,FRubio said there is 'zero evidence' the
OL,12,Fincidents are related.
